s not say whether any round overlaps the 34 pilot articles.","source_objects":[{"id":"S1","type":"text","label":"page 10 text","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/pages/page_010.md","page":10,"page_label":"10","section":null,"text_quote":"Table 6: Results of the LLM coding of rounds 2–4","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-e9b90e0f75ce05ff1ce150cc","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"A search for 'round' finds no definition of the numbering."}],"claim_evidence_links":[{"claim_text":"Rounds identifiable","source_object_ids":["S1"],"relation":"cannot_verify","note":"Round numbering is never defined in the retained text."}],"numeric_check":null,"suggested_fix":"Define the rounds once in Section 3.2 or Section 5, stating that round 1 is the pilot, and use the labels consistently."},{"id":"CROSSREF-005","category":"manuscript_crossref_issue","finding_summary":"The Figure 3 discussion says only the first quarter of 2024 is missing, while A.1 and the Figure 3 caption say listing text is missing from January to April 2024.","issue_type":"manuscript_issue","severity":"low","confidence":"medium","location":{"page":16,"page_label":"16","section":"A.2 / Figure 3","text_quote":"The first quarter of 2024 is missing","precision":"exact"},"claim_text":"The data gap described in the Figure 3 discussion matches the gap described in A.1 and the Figure 3 caption.","assessment":"partially","cannot_verify_reason":null,"evidence_summary":"Page 15 (A.1) says 'Listings from January to April 2024 are missing'. The Figure 3 caption says 'missing listing text from January to April 2024'. The Figure 3 paragraph says 'The first quarter of 2024 is missing', which covers only January to March. April falls in the second quarter. The quarterly figure's treatment of April 2024 is not stated. I did not view the Figure 3 image, so I cannot say whether Q2 2024 is drawn.","source_objects":[{"id":"S1","type":"text","label":"page 16 text","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/pages/page_016.md","page":16,"page_label":"16","section":null,"text_quote":"The first quarter of 2024 is missing","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-8f4894d007c8a183053537bc","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"Wording from the Figure 3 paragraph."},{"id":"S2","type":"text","label":"page 15 text (A.1)","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/pages/page_015.md","page":15,"page_label":"15","section":"A.1","text_quote":"Listings from January to April 2024 are missing","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-6402cd90a906f1f82672a86f","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"Gap definition."}],"claim_evidence_links":[{"claim_text":"Same gap described","source_object_ids":["S1","S2"],"relation":"partial","note":"Q1 versus January to April."}],"numeric_check":null,"suggested_fix":"Describe the gap consistently, for example as January to April 2024, and say how Q2 2024 is treated in Figure 3."},{"id":"CROSSREF-006","category":"section_inventory_artifact","finding_summary":"sections.json contains false headings (a body sentence, 'C. Keys for linkage to other registers', and SQL lines such as 'CROSS APPLY (' and 'FROM (VALUES'). It treats 'A.3 Technical details' as a section. It therefore cannot be used as a reliable index of section targets.","issue_type":"parser_artifact","severity":"low","confidence":"high","location":{"page":6,"page_label":"6","section":"3.2 LLM pipeline","text_quote":"A Python script was developed to call the model with the predefined prompt and write the coded","precision":"exact"},"claim_text":"The parsed section inventory lists only genuine manuscript headings.","assessment":"no","cannot_verify_reason":null,"evidence_summary":"The full text shows that 'A Python script was developed…' is an ordinary paragraph in Section 3.2, that 'C. Keys for linkage…' is a panel label inside Table 5, and that 'CROSS APPLY (' and 'FROM (VALUES' are SQL code in A.3.1. Real headings such as 4.3, 5 and A.3.2 are present, and every section number referenced in the text resolves against the full text. These false entries are a parsing issue, not a defect in the paper.","source_objects":[{"id":"S1","type":"parsed_artifact","label":"sections.json","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/sections.json","page":null,"page_label":null,"section":null,"text_quote":"A Python script was developed to call the model with the predefined prompt and write the coded","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-e41491b25ed5482e411e42ab","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"False heading entry."}],"claim_evidence_links":[{"claim_text":"Inventory holds only real headings","source_object_ids":["S1"],"relation":"contradicts","note":"Body sentence, table panel label and code lines listed as headings."}],"numeric_check":null,"suggested_fix":"Use the page text or full_text.md rather than sections.json to resolve section targets. Filter the code and table-panel lines out of the heading detector."}],"notes":["Internal references were resolved against full_text.md and the page text, not against sections.json alone. A search found no occurrence of 'Table 6' or 'Appendix B' outside their own captions and headings.","No equation, figure or appendix reference was found to be broken. Equations (1) and (2), Figures 1–4, Tables 1–5 and 7–9, and Appendices A, A.3.1 and A.3.2 all resolve."],"completion":{"version":1,"state":"complete","scope_description":"Audit of internal reference resolution, numbering consistency and appendix-label consistency across the full parsed text of the 18-page paper.","checks_completed":["Read parser_quality_auditor.json and used full_text.md and page text rather than the structured table CSV/markdown","Resolved every Section reference (2, 3.1, 3.2, 3.1.2, 4, 5, 6, 6.1, 6.3, 7, 8) against the headings in the full text","Resolved Table 1–9 and Figure 1–4 call-outs against captions and searched for uncited tables, figures and appendices","Checked equation (1)/(2) and 'model (1)/(2)' references","Checked Appendix A, A.1–A.3.2 and B labels and incoming references","Cross-checked footnote 3 and the 43/44-project and 92/96-article counts against Sections 4.1–4.2, Table 3 and Table 4","Compared crossrefs.json and sections.json with the full text to separate parser artifacts from manuscript issues"],"missing_checks":[],"evidence_limitations":["Checks relied on page text; page images were not viewed for this audit.","Figure 3's rendering of Q2 2024 could not be verified from text alone."]},"coverage":[{"item_id":"assigned_remit","source_object_ids":[],"claim":null,"check_performed":"Resolved all section, table, figure, equation and appendix references in the full text; checked numbering and appendix labels; compared the parser's crossrefs.json and sections.json with the text; checked footnote 3 against Section 4.1 and Table 3.","status":"linked_finding","reason":"Five genuine manuscript cross-reference issues and one section-inventory parser artifact were found. All other references resolved. Scope was exhaustive over the retained text; images were not viewed.","finding_ids":["CROSSREF-001","CROSSREF-002","CROSSREF-003","CROSSREF-004","CROSSREF-005","CROSSREF-006"],"attempted":true,"importance":"central","scope":"exhaustive"}]},"ttft_ms":2109,"type":"result","duration_ms":103742,"uuid":"69fa9e79-b6c8-45be-8b18-db54868133e6","ttft_stream_ms":1377,"time_to_request_ms":172,"first_content_frame_ms":1377,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-08T17:18:28.888Z"}
